<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  Motus.NET experimental fixture: Unitree H2 (meshless kinematic tree).
  Source: unitree_ros/robots/h2_description/H2.urdf
  https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_ros/tree/master/robots/h2_description
  License: BSD-3-Clause (HangZhou YuShu TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD. / Unitree Robotics)

  Motus adaptations (this file only):
  - Stripped visual/collision/inertial/material/mujoco (joints/links only).
  - Pelvis-rooted: stock floating_base_joint (world→pelvis) omitted / not loaded
    (Motus rejects type="floating"). Equivalent to fixed-base tree FK.
  - Do NOT confuse with Unitree H1-2 (h1_2_description).

  Experimental honesty: upper-body / full-tree FK + optional arm PlanningGroup.
  NOT biped walk, balance, WBC, or Family=legged locomotion.
  ~31 revolute drivers (6/leg ×2 + 7/arm ×2 + 3 waist + 2 head).
-->
